  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Controllers disappear when you hover them over something you can grab. This could be your camera or another object in the world. A moment after your controllers disappeared the rest of your trackers vanish.\n\nThat the trackers disappear is consistent for me after a few seconds when both controllers are gone after hovering the camera. But not when hovering a world object. (from what I've seen) Same behaviour is seen in legacy and the new calibration.\n\nWhen testing I had a quest pro with handtracking plus index controllers. \n\nDoes not seem to be a problem on live. \n\nvideo: https://youtu.be/0pJgWCeSpBs\n\nEdit:\n\nSeems like I have the reverse problem as well. Trackers and controllers sometimes show up after hovering objects. Have verified with a friend that he is experiencing the same thing. \n\nI also get shown all my trackers when I open the VRC keyboard.\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/MihdwWCyF2s",
